      "author_handle": "Newlywed84",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 13 years 2 months ago",
      "body": "Hi, i've really been struggling since my daughters birth, a friend mentioned about Snugglebundl and i've been really impressed. My stitches no longer pull when i'm picking her up. So nice to be able to enjoy her and not worry i'm going to do myself any damage.",
